[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4513253692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119643#issuecomment-4513253692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119643","id":4513253692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDQLJPA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-21T22:23:22Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T22:23:22Z","body":"They are present within the editor: \n\n<img width=\"709\" height=\"68\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cf2050b-893c-444e-a51e-aa70b94c29ea\" />\n\nThe reason they don't appear in the project manager is that we only have one page of *projects/templates/demos* so far ([20 as of writing](https://store.godotengine.org/search/?query=%23template)). Once more projects/templates/demos are submitted to the asset library, pagination will start to appear.\n\nThat said, we should probably display the pagination even if there's only one page to avoid ambiguity.\n\ncc @YeldhamDev ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/r